<title>USA: Kelley Oil names David Baggett CFO.</title>
<headline>Kelley Oil names David Baggett CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kelley Oil &amp; Gas Corp said Tuesday that David Baggett had been elected senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said he succeeds William Rankin, whose last day as CFO was March 14.</p>
<p>No further information was available.</p>
<p>Baggett was formerly with Deloitte &amp; Touche LLP as partner-in-charge of the energy and mergers and acquisitions practices in the Houston office, Kelley said.</p>
